SUMMARY:[Kayaking] Annual Kayak Klinic ** Date Change
DESCRIPTION:GTA Hiking & Stuff\n**\\*\\*\\* Please Note the date change! U
 pdate your attendance if necessary \\*\\*\\*\\***\n\nOur annual Kayak Klin
 ic!\n\nNew to kayaking? Want to try kayaking? Need help installing a roof 
 rack or tying your kayak to the car? What safety equipment do you need?\n\
 nHave a kayak and want to get out and kayak with friends?\n\nJoin us to an
 swer these questions and get help to prepare for a great kayaking summer. 
 I will have some experienced kayakers to answer questions and help you out
 .\n\nThe event will be held at the Caesarea Municipal Ramp Boat Launch ([h
 ttps://maps.app.goo.gl/1273omu8gRMC88Ud8](https://maps.app.goo.gl/1273omu8
 gRMC88Ud8)).\n\n**Please Note:** There is very limited parking in this are
 a and we would like to reserve this area for those bringing a kayak. If yo
 u're renting\, please consider car-pooling. Please observe all No Parking 
 areas and be respectful of the surrounding neighbourhood.\n\n**Kayak Renta
 l**\nFor those without a kayak\, we have partnered with Freedom Canoe & Ka
 yak ([http://freedomcanoe.com/](http://freedomcanoe.com/)) in Caesarea to 
 rent a kayak. (4 Cedar Grove Dr\, Caesarea). You can visit or call (289-20
 0-4737) to arrange your rental. They will arrange to get the kayak to the 
 launch site.\n\n**NOTE**: All kayaking events will require the proper safe
 ty equipment and that you wear your lifejacket when in/on the water.\n\n**
